| bytes | BWT primary row | full round trip | median rank | mean rank | empirical marginal entropy bits/rank |
| ---: | ---: | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| 79 | 63 | true | 0 | 22.126582278481013 | 1.6983272366010005 |
\image(figures/mtf_original.svg)
// result_end
